# Figma → Storybook copy

When converting Figma components to Storybook, **preserve the Lorem Ipsum placeholder text from the design**. Do not replace it with AI-generated marketing copy, brand messaging, or invented stats.

## Use Figma copy as-is

- Headings, body, eyebrows, CTAs, stat labels, and nav items should match Figma (typically Lorem ipsum variants).
- Keep emphasis markers from Figma, e.g. `*Lorem ipsum* dolor sit amet.`
- Image `alt` text in stories: use `""` for decorative images or a short Lorem fragment — not descriptive AI captions.

## Do not invent

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — AI-generated placeholders
title: "Rescuing food, feeding communities."
body: "Sharing Excess partners with grocery stores..."
label: "lbs rescued"
imageAlt: "Food rescue at Trader Joe's loading dock"

// ✅ GOOD — Figma Lorem Ipsum
title: "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet *conspectus*."
body: "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nunc vulputate libero et velit interdum, ac aliquet odio mattis."
label: "Lorem ipsum"
primaryCta: "Primary CTA"
imageAlt: ""
```

Real site copy belongs in Astro pages (`web/src/pages/`), not in `*.stories.tsx`.
